<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Plaza year net profit up 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Hotel Plaza year net profit up 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  10.31     vs     7.60</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		2.58     vs     1.90</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		 4.00     vs     4.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			   168.85     vs   126.64</p>
<p>    Interest/other income	    3.80     vs     3.41</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  19.72     vs    15.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation			17.18     vs    14.12</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    15.94     vs    10.68</p>
<p>    Associates (loss)		  0.26     vs     0.23 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax				    3.90     vs     3.59</p>
<p>    Minorities		(loss)   1.48     vs     0.74 (gain)</p>
<p>    Dividend register date:	 June 4, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the company is Hotel Plaza Ltd.</p>
</text>
